35,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,The tally shows two people use it eleven times. The rest use it four.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,The last awkward talk happened in front of everyone. We have no private space.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,May,,The lunch trip takes twenty-five minutes. We do it three days a week.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"We paid 68,000 yen for outside hire. The fit-out quotes are 141,000 and 96,000.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,The wall is thin plasterboard. You can hear everything. The fridge was cleared twice.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shunichi, 68,000 yen is significant. But the fit-out for a meeting space is higher.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Servas, if the wall is thin, a quiet room is impossible without soundproofing.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,May,,"@Ryuji, if two people dominate, a shared kitchen might be better for the others.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, the kitchen fit-out is cheaper. But do we want to cook here?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Jonathan, a meeting space with a screen might justify the cost if we stop hiring out.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,The crumbs under keyboards suggest eating at desks is a problem. A kitchen might fix that.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"The unplanned talk is gone. We need a space that encourages connection, not just work.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,May,,The facilities callouts were for equipment. A kitchen adds more equipment to maintain.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,The invoices show we pay for small groups. A meeting space could replace that.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,The old fridge was a mess. A new kitchen needs strict rules to avoid that.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
