60,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,Option A is a kitchen. Option B is a quiet room. Option C is a meeting space.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,Option C seems best for our social needs. We need to talk.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,May,,Option A saves us time on lunch. But who cleans?,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Option C replaces the 68,000 yen we pay outside. It is financially sound.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Servas,,Option B is impossible with that wall. Option A is messy. Option C is practical.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shunichi, the cost of C is 141,000. It is high, but it saves the hire fees.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@May, if we agree on rules, the kitchen could work. But I prefer C.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,May,,"@Ryuji, the tally shows only two people use it often. A kitchen might be underused.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Servas, you are right about the wall. B is out. A is risky. C is stable.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Servas,,"@Jonathan, I agree. C allows for the conversations we lack.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,I vote for C. It solves the usage imbalance and the cost.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,I vote for C. It restores our ability to connect.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,May,,I vote for A. It saves my time. But I will accept C if it is the majority.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,I vote for C. The numbers support it.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Servas,,I vote for C. It is the most sustainable choice.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
